  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Boosting Sustainable Food Production in Kenya (BSFPK)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Goal:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To boost food production through promotion of good agricultural practices (more specifically Conservation Agriculture) and enhanced access to subsidized agricultural inputs, technologies and Services&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Result Areas:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xfc; 1. Efficient and climate-resilient agricultural crop production promoted and in practice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xfc; 2. Access to subsidized agricultural inputs, technologies and services through mobile-based e-voucher platform.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xfc;&amp;nbsp;3. Policy and Institutional support for improved sustainable agriculture and food security&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
